The content of this repository — the consolidated text of Dutch legislation as
maintained in the Basis Wetten Bestand (BWB) and republished here in Markdown
form — is in the public domain.

Per Dutch copyright law (Auteurswet, article 11), works of legislation, judicial
decisions, and administrative decisions are not protected by copyright. KOOP
(Kennis- en Exploitatiecentrum voor Officiële Overheidspublicaties), the official
publisher of the BWB, releases the source XML under CC0 1.0 Universal.

The markdown transformation in this repository follows the same CC0 1.0 Universal
license. You can copy, modify, distribute and perform the work, even for commercial
purposes, all without asking permission.

Full license text: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

To the extent possible under law, the person who associated CC0 with this work has
waived all copyright and related or neighboring rights to this work.
